Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.36,0:01:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of you need to run.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.91,0:01:37.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evacuate the island!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.44,0:01:40.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talking\Nabout, Sentomaru?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.86,0:01:43.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know\Nsomething we don't?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.72,0:01:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going\Nto happen to Egghead?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.87,0:01:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.18,0:01:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you deploy\Nthe pacifistas?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:52.16,0:01:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Years ago there was a place called Ohara,\Nan island of scholars that disappeared one
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.53,0:01:58.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,day, wiped out.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.12,0:02:05.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They called them fanatics.\NTraitors to the government.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And their punishment\Nwas death.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.21,0:02:17.74,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Island of Ohara was once\Nhome to the greatest library in the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.16,0:02:21.99,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Its scholars attempted to decipher\Nthe Poneglyphs, taking a glimpse into
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.07,0:02:23.08,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,forbidden history,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.16,0:02:25.77,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and the Government's\Njudgment was fierce.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.85,0:02:29.79,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,They instituted a Buster Call,\Nleveling the island to the ground in a
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.87,0:02:31.25,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,massive bombardment.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.33,0:02:36.10,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The destruction was so vast that\Nonly one young girl survived.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.18,0:02:37.73,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.53,0:02:44.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk has the greatest mind in the whole\Nworld, and the World Government still
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.43,0:02:46.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,chose to put him\Nin their crosshairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.88,0:02:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over and over, they've\Nmade one thing clear.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.99,0:02:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They will kill anyone\Nto bury their secrets.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.32,0:03:02.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't escape, you'll end up\Njust like the scholars of Ohara.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.03,0:03:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island may be doomed,\Nbut you don't have to die with it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.49,0:03:16.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,60)}C'mon, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.62,0:03:17.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,60)}Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.22,0:03:17.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,60)}Hurry up.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.82,0:03:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have\Na moment to lose!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.55,0:03:33.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aaaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.94,0:03:37.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.94,0:03:41.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohh!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.70,0:04:04.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hand Pistol!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.38,0:04:06.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.18,0:04:08.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Yellow Lotus!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.68,0:04:11.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Woooaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.63,0:04:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.68,0:04:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,White thunder!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.96,0:04:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One-Sword Style Draw!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.91,0:07:29.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ruts!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.29,0:09:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Barg!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.51,0:10:56.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.79,0:12:43.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.51,0:12:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Help love me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.25,0:13:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are Lilith!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.93,0:16:54.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.83,0:16:55.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.48,0:16:59.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unpetrify me right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.58,0:19:04.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.43,0:19:29.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.92,0:25:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.70,0:04:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Tempest Kick...
